1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
We are Team Azoic from Dhaka,
taking on NASA's Field Shift challenge!

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:12,000
In Bangladesh's Barind tract, rigid Boro–Aman monocultures
are draining groundwater and leaving soils bare.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:22,000
FieldShift models the farmer's existing rotation against three NASA-informed alternatives—
using GPM IMERG, POWER, SMAP, MODIS, and GRACE to cut water demand and build soil health.

4
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:30,000
One hundred percent offline, scientifically honest, and verified with local extension officers.
FieldShift: Earth observations adapting real farms.
